                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/membrane"} membrane
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p
            Lecture notes in view of application to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbative+quantum+field+theory"} perturbative quantum field theory
            via
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldline+formalism"} worldline formalism
          %ul
            %li
              Olindo Corradini,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christian+Schubert"} Christian Schubert
              %em Spinning Particles in Quantum Mechanics and Quantum Field Theory
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.08694"}> arXiv:1512.08694
              )
          %p
            Discussion that cancellation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+anomaly"} quantum anomaly
            of the spinning particle precisely requires
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin-structure"} Spin-structure
            on its
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target+spacetime"} target spacetime
          %ul
            %li#Witten85
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Global anomalies in string theory
              = succeed "," do
                %em Symposium on Anomalies, Geometry, Topology
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/214913"} spire:214913
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/WittenGlobalAnomaliesInStringTheory.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldline"} worldline
            dynamics of spinning particles in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/background+fields"} background fields
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan-Willem+van+Holten"}> Jan-Willem van Holten
                ,
                %em Relativistic Dynamics of Spin in Strong External Fields
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9303124"}> arXiv:hep-th/9303124
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                A. Pomeranskii, R A Sen’kov, I.B. Khriplovich,
                %em Spinning relativistic particles in external fields
                Acta Physica Polonica B Proceedings Supplement Vol. 1 (2008) (
                %a{:href => "http://iopscience.iop.org/1063-7869/43/10/R03"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                Krzysztof Andrzejewski, Cezary Gonera, Joanna Goner, Piotr Kosinski, Pawel Maslanka,
                %em Spinning particles, coadjoint orbits and Hamiltonian formalism
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.09478"}> arXiv:2008.09478
                )
          %p
            Discussion via
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coadjoint+orbits"} coadjoint orbits
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Basile"}> Thomas Basile
              , Euihun Joung, TaeHwan Oh:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Manifestly Covariant Worldline Actions from Coadjoint Orbits. Part I: Generalities and Vectorial Descriptions
              %strong 2024
              18 (2024). &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.13644"}> arXiv:2307.13644
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %div
            %h3#SupergeometryOfFermionFieldsReferences Supergeometry of fermion fields
            %p
              Discussion of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+mechanics"} classical mechanics
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spinning+particle"} spinning particle
              or of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+field+theory"} classical field theory
              with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fermion"} fermion
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} fields
              (possibly but
              %em not necessarily
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} super-symmetric
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergeometry"} supergeometry
            %p
